# The build context is copied into the image, so keep it to sources. The host's
# build trees are the big one: `build/` alone is hundreds of megabytes of MSVC
# state that the Linux build would ignore anyway — and a stale CMakeCache from
# another generator is worse than useless if it ever did get in.
build/
build-linux/
out/
.git/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.cache/
compile_commands.json
CMakeUserPresets.json
*.user
